## Intentionally empty: msgstrs fall back to msgids, which ARE
## the English text. The file exists so `Gettext.known_locales/1`
## returns "en" alongside the translated locales — without it,
## `Localize.LanguageTag.best_match("en", [<known>])` falls
## through to the first non-English entry, causing every
## "en" request to render in some other locale.
